flowchart LR
  R[Business requirement] --> C[Source and data contract]
  C --> S[Silver conformance\nand grain checks]
  S --> G[Gold data product]
  G --> Q[DQ and freshness gate]
  Q --> M[Semantic model\nand measures]
  M --> D[DA reports and analysis]
  D --> A[Copilot context\ntools and flows]
  A --> U[SCM user workflow]
  Q -. fail closed .-> X[Investigate / repair / rerun]
  X --> S
